  {
   "vo": "And this wasn't a timid Indian batting line-up. Against pace, अभिषेक शर्मा struck at two hundred and forty-two. Naman Dhir, two hundred. वैभव सूर्यवंशी, one ninety-five. As a team, India scored at one seventy against the seamers.",
