  {
   "vo": "So who struggled most? तिलक वर्मा made just eighteen off twenty-one balls against him. श्रेयस अय्यर scored at a run a ball and fell to him twice. संजू सैमसन struck at one-fourteen. Only Naman Dhir really took him on.",
